{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6a571b6f41f3a6d7ccca44d261294ec5a080a1284e86d87282229926430b8769",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e76da11de8aea4ce5f4c1feaebb8a038e0a30138f719825b2b4d49b255151e0",
      "text": "辛苦了，师父！\n哈哈抱歉，我太兴奋了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17867e1114f8a4d36be2b287563e756ac59d5ec596cfc34530097fa50daae4ad",
      "text": "回想起今天的录制，\n整个人又燃起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cfc868476533658e4618d2214cce0056b596f7d263a6c2c968c9844bd1773b",
      "text": "师父，请让我再次向你道谢。答应了我们各种\n任性的要求，真的很感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a350d54dbbad1b8573bea472a89c70a32d034d40452f9239f23ac031289ef497",
      "text": "我只是回应了大家的热情而已",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75bdfbd5b0d7f409bc7f81fd4bc2e0317092d1b43b59b25324333ab607e29ef0",
      "text": "热情吗。确实，感觉这次比平时任何时候\n都还要热血沸腾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9268345b56a73ba6c97d9ef3130a8ddfeff01eb2f1bd4ac72925410327229531",
      "text": "私下跟师父说，之前碰头会那会儿，\n我也差点想狠狠顶回去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:585aa70491cc9d803aee238b1b2de35a6bf839d4d07623341471f05422cf05f3",
      "text": "只是当着武和涟的面，\n勉强克制住了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:126e8dcdd9e0cda10748f4f1245285cccfb4b1dd0112e6b0aa612a00c9514505",
      "text": "正因如此，反倒更加投入了吧。哈哈。\n托你的福，我们发挥出了很棒的现场表现力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3de5278e4c2ce432da9f72afc52cf4e342fe73028460b248018a32a5438c638",
      "text": "但是，我觉得我们绝不仅止于此。\n我有确信，我们还能达到更高的高度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:039mcr_307_2_3_039_07_09_a:2_3_039_07_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2940f91c66d3ac7c9b8758dd28d33985adb61e9345e1c3651460a1a4d9565494",
      "text": "我们一定会证明给你看的，今后也请继续期待！\n那么，今天就先失陪了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
